{"parse": {"title": "共鸣晶匣", "pageid": 2143, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"共鸣晶匣\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8e/Item-481005.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"共鸣晶匣\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>共鸣晶匣</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#481010</div></div><hr /><div>贮藏着共鸣晶体的木匣。开启后可从中挑选指定的高阶共鸣晶体，用以提升角色共鸣。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">细碎之声满溢其中，珍惜倾听的机会。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/120001\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%82%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%95%B8%E9%B8%A3\" title=\"迂回的啸鸣\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%82%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%95%B8%E9%B8%A3\" title=\"迂回的啸鸣\"><img alt=\"迂回的啸鸣\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Item-120001.png/100px-Item-120001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Item-120001.png/150px-Item-120001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Item-120001.png/200px-Item-120001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%82%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%95%B8%E9%B8%A3\" title=\"迂回的啸鸣\">迂回的啸鸣</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">迂回曲折的啸鸣，难以捕捉。常在重要的共鸣仪式中使用。<br />用于提升角色共鸣。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/120002\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E6%88%98%E6%A0%97\" title=\"交错的战栗\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E6%88%98%E6%A0%97\" title=\"交错的战栗\"><img alt=\"交错的战栗\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Item-120002.png/100px-Item-120002.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Item-120002.png/150px-Item-120002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Item-120002.png/200px-Item-120002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" d